` as the reviewer, which is a placeholder rather than a real handle, so no one has been notified. Someone needs to add the actual code owner(s) or assign the review directly.\n- Once a code owner approves, the PR can be merged and the fix will ship in today's release. If you give me the code owner's handle, I can request their review on #101. I'll hold off on merging until approval is recorded.", "type": "text"}]}]}